-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ד/3 (16.8.2023): פתיחת תיקי גננות ודיווח משרות; העסקת
-- עובדי הוראה, עובדי בעלות, בגני הילדים לחינוך מיוחד המוכרים שאינם רשמיים,
-- בהתאם לרפורמת אופק חדש בשנה"ל תשפ"ד
-- Part א: what the owners of recognised unofficial special-education
-- kindergartens must do so that the Ministry can compute their profile —
-- a reporting officer, online files, employment approvals, reports of
-- positions. Part ב: how those kindergartens join Ofek Hadash in התשפ"ד —
-- the owner's undertaking and duties, the Ministry's, who joins, the work
-- week and position base, part-time and over-time, mothers, age hours,
-- activity hours, seniority, promotion, the allowances, the grade and the
-- advances until it is set; and the annexes: the letter, the forms and the
-- worked examples.
--
-- Corpus note: the corpus nests the circular's part ב under section ו's
-- stage ה, its sign-off and the owner's undertaking under §17.3, and prints
-- several tables (4.1.1, 4.1.4, 12.2, 14 and annex ה) as loose lines; the
-- keys below are the corpus's.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT time
IMPORT common

-- Time for the deadlines is counted in DAYS from the circular's date,
-- 16.8.2023 (0).
`the circular's date` MEANS Date 16 8 2023

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `days from the circular to` d IS
    Day d MINUS Day `the circular's date`

`31 August 2023`   MEANS `days from the circular to` (Date 31 8 2023)
`31 December 2023` MEANS `days from the circular to` (Date 31 12 2023)

#ASSERT `31 August 2023` EQUALS 15
#ASSERT `31 December 2023` EQUALS 137

§ `חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ד/3 — גני ילדים לחינוך מיוחד מוכרים שאינם רשמיים`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference number, addressees (owners of recognised unofficial special-education kindergartens not yet in Ofek Hadash), greeting, the two subjects and the purpose line; no rule.
-- akn:art_a The heading of part א (reporting for the kindergartens' profile: files and positions); its rules are below.
-- akn:art_b The heading of part ב (employment under Ofek Hadash in התשפ"ד, instructions to owners joining); its rules are below.

@desc The kinds of post the circular distinguishes in a special-education kindergarten.
DECLARE `kindergarten post` IS ONE OF
    `kindergarten manager teacher`      @desc גננת מנהלת גן
    `colleague kindergarten teacher`    @desc גננת עמיתה (formerly גננת משלימה)
    `kindergarten cluster manager`      @desc מנהלת אשכול גנים
    `cluster kindergarten coordinator`  @desc מרכזת גן באשכול גנים
    `health-professions employee`       @desc occupational therapy, physiotherapy, speech therapy
    `arts therapist`                    @desc visual art, movement, drama, music, bibliotherapy, psychodrama

@desc A teaching employee of the owner in a recognised unofficial special-education kindergarten, as far as this circular asks.
DECLARE `kindergarten employee` HAS
    `post`                                  IS A `kindergarten post`
    `has recognised years of actual teaching` IS A BOOLEAN @desc years of seniority for actual teaching were recognised before, by an employer outside the civil service or in it (section 3.1.1)
    `is academic`                           IS A BOOLEAN @desc section 3.1.3
    `holds a teaching certification`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc section 3.1.4
    `seniority in teaching`                 IS A NUMBER  @desc recognised years of seniority in teaching
    `age on 31 December`                    IS A NUMBER  @desc age on 31 December of the school year (section 8.1)
    `position fraction`                     IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position (1 = full)
    `is an intern`                          IS A BOOLEAN @desc a teaching intern (מתמחה, סטאז'ר)
    `holds a special-education certification` IS A BOOLEAN
    `entitled to the nursing hour`          IS A BOOLEAN @desc within four months of the end of maternity leave (section 7.4)
    `mother of a child under 14`            IS A BOOLEAN @desc mother of a child up to the age of 14

§§ `א. דיווח מצבת עובדי ההוראה`

-- The yearly duty: from התשפ"א every teaching employee of a recognised
-- unofficial special-education kindergarten opens an online file with the
-- Ministry, and the owner reports the employment, every year.
DECLARE `circular 3 action` IS ONE OF
    `appoint a reporting officer` HAS `is the owner's employee` IS A BOOLEAN
                                      `officers appointed` IS A NUMBER
    `instruct the employees to open online files`
    `open an online file`
    `approve the file and verify the documents`
    `report the institution code`
    `instruct existing employees to check their data`
    `obtain an employment approval`
    `report the positions`
    `sign and send the undertaking`
    `submit an exceptions request` HAS `kind of request` IS A STRING
    `transfer the salary interface`
    `pay by the grade` HAS `months of arrears` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the Ofek Hadash advance` HAS `advance` IS A NUMBER
    `deduct the advances` HAS `deducted` IS A NUMBER
    `approve the owner's joining`
    `reimburse the owner`
    `transfer the reporting authorisation`

@ref akn:art_b__para_a akn:art_b__para_a/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the teaching employee opens a file and the owner reports` IS
    (PARTY `the teaching employee`
     MUST  `open an online file`
     WITHIN 365)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the employer`
     MUST  `report the positions`
     WITHIN 365
     LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "the owner reports the employment of every teaching employee to the Ministry every year")

-- akn:art_b__para_a/p3 The purpose of the reporting (an infrastructure of data like that of the recognised unofficial schools); no rule.
-- akn:art_b__para_a/p4 What the Ministry, as regulator, will do with the data (education degree, certification, seniority, further rights, employment approvals, criminal-record checks, the profile); no rule addressed to the owner.
-- akn:art_b__para_a/p5 A request to act by the instructions that follow; their rules are encoded below.
-- akn:art_b__para_a/p6 The lead-in to the owner's actions ("להלן הפעולות הנדרשות מהבעלות"); no rule of its own.

-- Stage א: the owner defines exactly ONE reporting officer, an employee
-- of the owner (in employer–employee relations, not a service provider),
-- preferably from human resources.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p8
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the owner appoints one reporting officer` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `appoint a reporting officer` employee n PROVIDED employee AND n EQUALS 1
    WITHIN 365
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "stage א: one reporting officer only, an employee of the owner"

-- An owner that has not yet defined one fills the authorisation form
-- (by its contact person) and e-mails it to the Ministry; the senior HR
-- division checks it and, once approved, authorises the officer in the
-- Ministry's systems for file approvals, position reports and feedback.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p5 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p6
GIVEN `form submitted` IS A BOOLEAN, `form approved by the HR division` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reporting officer is authorised` `form submitted` `form approved by the HR division` IF
    `form submitted` AND `form approved by the HR division`

-- The authorisation is personal and may not be passed to another contact;
-- a change of officer needs a written request to the Ministry.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p7
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the authorisation is not passed on` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `transfer the reporting authorisation`
    WITHIN 365
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "stage א: the authorisation is personal and may not be passed to another contact"

-- akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_2 The heading of stage ב (opening online files); its rules follow.

-- Stage ב: every year the owner instructs its teaching employees
-- (kindergarten teachers and health-professions staff) — new ones and those
-- with no file — to open an online file through the teachers' portal; the
-- employee fills the questionnaire (personal details, education, a request
-- for placement, declarations, documents).
@ref akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_2__cls_a akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_2__cls_b
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the owner instructs employees to open files` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `instruct the employees to open online files`
    WITHIN 365
    HENCE (PARTY `the teaching employee`
           MUST  `open an online file`
           WITHIN 365)
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "stage ב: every year the owner instructs new employees and those without a file to open one"

-- Section ג: once the employee has filed, the reporting officer approves
-- the file, verifies the documents as true copies and updates the code of
-- the institution of placement — for a kindergarten cluster, the CLUSTER's
-- code and not the kindergarten's.
@ref akn:art_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the reporting officer approves the file` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `approve the file and verify the documents`
    WITHIN 30
    HENCE (PARTY `the employer`
           MUST  `report the institution code`
           WITHIN 30)
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section ג: the reporting officer approves the file and verifies the documents"

@ref akn:art_c
GIVEN `works in a kindergarten cluster` IS A BOOLEAN, `cluster code` IS A STRING, `kindergarten code` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the institution code to report` `works in a kindergarten cluster` `cluster code` `kindergarten code` IS
    IF `works in a kindergarten cluster` THEN `cluster code` ELSE `kindergarten code`

-- Section ד: the three stages of opening a file and whose each is.
DECLARE `file stage` HAS
    `stage number` IS A NUMBER
    `responsible`  IS A Party
    `what is done` IS A STRING

@ref akn:art_d/p1 akn:art_d/p2 akn:art_d/p3 akn:art_d/p4 akn:art_d/p5
`the stages of opening a file` MEANS
    LIST `file stage` 1 `the teaching employee` "fill and send the questionnaire with the education and seniority documents",
         `file stage` 2 `the employer` "approve the documents as true copies, approve the file, report the institution of placement",
         `file stage` 3 `the Ministry of Education` "update grade and seniority, approve the documents, approve the file"

-- akn:art_e Detailed instructions for employees are published in the teachers' portal, with a user guide; no rule.

-- Section ו: the owner instructs existing employees (with a file) to check
-- in the portal that their education and seniority data are current; other
-- data are updated through the district's HR unit in one of three ways.
@ref akn:art_f
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the owner instructs existing employees to check their data` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `instruct existing employees to check their data`
    WITHIN 365
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section ו: the owner instructs existing employees to check their data"

DECLARE `way to update data` IS ONE OF
    `originals brought by the employee to the district's HR clerks in reception hours`
    `originals posted by the employee to the district's HR division`
    `a request through the owner's reporting officer, with true copies by e-mail`

@ref akn:art_f akn:art_f/p2 akn:art_f/p3 akn:art_f/p4
`the ways to update data` MEANS
    LIST `originals brought by the employee to the district's HR clerks in reception hours`,
         `originals posted by the employee to the district's HR division`,
         `a request through the owner's reporting officer, with true copies by e-mail`

#ASSERT count `the ways to update data` EQUALS 3

-- Section ו's fifth paragraph: the districts' contact details and
-- reception hours "are set out in annex ח'". F-2023-24_tashpad_03-d: the
-- circular has annexes א' to ו' and no annex ח'; the contacts are annex ו'
-- (as §17.3 says). The reading adopted: annex ו'.
@ref akn:art_f/p5
`the annexes the circular has` MEANS LIST "א", "ב", "ג", "ד", "ה", "ו"
`the annex section ו names for the district contacts` MEANS "ח"

`section ו's annex ח does not exist` MEANS
    NOT elem `the annex section ו names for the district contacts` `the annexes the circular has`
#ASSERT `section ו's annex ח does not exist`

-- akn:art_f/p6 Pointer to the attached portal instructions on opening a file; no rule.

-- Stage ג: the owner obtains an employment approval for every teaching
-- employee, by the procedure for candidates for התשפ"ד (an input).
@ref akn:art_f__para_3/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the owner obtains employment approvals` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `obtain an employment approval`
    WITHIN 365
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "stage ג: an employment approval for every teaching employee"

-- Stage ד: every teaching employee teaching in the kindergartens is placed
-- in the Ministry's reporting systems — those who meet the joining
-- conditions under the reform's terms, the others under pre-reform terms —
-- and the duty binds every owner, joined to Ofek Hadash in התשפ"א–התשפ"ד or not.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3/p2 akn:art_f__para_3/p3 akn:art_f__para_3/p4
GIVEN `owner joined Ofek Hadash in התשפ"א–התשפ"ד` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `stage ד: the owner reports every position` `owner joined Ofek Hadash in התשפ"א–התשפ"ד` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `report the positions`
    WITHIN 365
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "stage ד: the reporting duty binds every owner, joined to Ofek Hadash or not"

-- Stage ה: after the earlier stages, the owner's profile is computed in the
-- עוש"ר system from its employees' characteristics and the owner's reports.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4/p1
GIVEN `files opened` IS A BOOLEAN, `positions reported` IS A BOOLEAN, `approvals obtained` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the profile can be computed` `files opened` `positions reported` `approvals obtained` IF
    `files opened` AND `positions reported` AND `approvals obtained`

§§ `ב.1 מבוא`

-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b The heading of part ב; its rules follow.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1 The heading "מבוא".
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p2 History: the State's notice in HCJ 6677/19 that it would equalise teaching resources; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p3 History: the inter-ministerial team and the director-general's adoption of its conclusions from התשפ"א; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p4 Pointer to the team's report; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p5 The report's link; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p6 History: Ofek Hadash's terms applied to these kindergartens from התשפ"א; no rule.

-- The State Education (Recognised Institutions) Regulations as amended in
-- התשפ"ב (reg. 3(6)): in a special-education institution, salaries by the
-- rates and rules of official special-education institutions in the new
-- programme — so every special-education kindergarten not yet joined joins
-- from התשפ"ד.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p7 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p8 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p9 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p10
GIVEN `school year` IS A NUMBER @desc the school year by its first calendar year (2023 = התשפ"ד)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the kindergarten is in Ofek Hadash` `school year` IF
    `school year` AT LEAST 2023

-- The Ministry is the only body that approves an employee's joining, sets
-- the Ofek Hadash grade and converts the salary; it also sets the
-- education degree and the seniority in teaching.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p11
GIVEN p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may approve joining and set the grade` p IF
    p EQUALS `the Ministry of Education`

-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p12 The scope of part ב (owner-employed teaching staff in these kindergartens in התשפ"ד); no rule of its own.

§§ `ב.2 תחומי אחריות ביישום הרפורמה`

-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_2 The heading "תחומי אחריות ביישום הרפורמה".
-- akn:art_f__para_2-1 The heading "שלב ראשון".
-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1 The heading of 2.1.1, the owner's actions; they follow.

-- 2.1.1(1): until the regulations are amended, the owner undertakes to
-- apply Ofek Hadash; the undertaking goes to the Ministry by e-mail, the
-- annexes א' and ב' stay with the owner, and the last day is 31.8.2023.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p3 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p4 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p5
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the owner signs the undertaking by 31.8.2023` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `sign and send the undertaking`
    WITHIN `31 August 2023`
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "2.1.1(1): the last day to send the undertaking is 31.8.2023"

-- F-2023-24_tashpad_03-e: 2.1.1(1) has the owner undertake to apply Ofek
-- Hadash "על בתי הספר לחינוך מיוחד שבבעלותה" — its special-education
-- SCHOOLS — while the circular, its addressees and the undertaking's own
-- text (item 1) concern its special-education KINDERGARTENS. The reading
-- adopted: the kindergartens, as the undertaking itself says.
DECLARE `institution kind` IS ONE OF
    `special-education kindergarten`
    `special-education school`

@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1
`what 2.1.1(1) has the owner undertake for` MEANS `special-education school`
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_1
`what the undertaking's item 1 applies to` MEANS `special-education kindergarten`

`2.1.1(1) and the undertaking name different institutions` MEANS
    NOT (`what 2.1.1(1) has the owner undertake for` EQUALS `what the undertaking's item 1 applies to`)
#ASSERT `2.1.1(1) and the undertaking name different institutions`

-- 2.1.1(2)–(4): open the files (part א), locate the employees who meet the
-- joining conditions (section 3), report the positions of all, meeting the
-- conditions or not.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p6 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p7 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p8 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p9 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p10
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the owner opens files and reports every position` IS
    (PARTY `the employer`
     MUST  `instruct the employees to open online files`
     WITHIN 365)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the employer`
     MUST  `report the positions`
     WITHIN 365
     LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "2.1.1(4): report the positions of all the employees, meeting the joining conditions or not")

-- 2.1.1(5): those who meet the joining conditions are employed by Ofek
-- Hadash's work week and paid by its terms; until the grade is set, by the
-- terms of the Ofek Hadash advance — "כפי שיפורט להלן בסעיף 12".
-- F-2023-24_tashpad_03-a: section 12 is the kindergarten teachers'
-- allowances; the advance is section 17. 2.1.1(9) cites "סעיף 12" for the
-- advances again. The reading adopted: section 17.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_5 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_9
`the section 2.1.1(5) and (9) cite for the advance` MEANS 12
`the section that sets the advance` MEANS 17
`the advance is cited as section 12 but is section 17` MEANS
    NOT (`the section 2.1.1(5) and (9) cite for the advance` EQUALS `the section that sets the advance`)
#ASSERT `the advance is cited as section 12 but is section 17`

DECLARE `pay basis` IS ONE OF
    `Ofek Hadash terms by the grade`
    `pre-reform pay with the Ofek Hadash advance`
    `pre-reform terms`

@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_5
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`, `grade set` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `pay basis`
DECIDE `the pay basis of` e `grade set` IS
    IF NOT `joins Ofek Hadash` e
    THEN `pre-reform terms`
    ELSE IF `grade set`
         THEN `Ofek Hadash terms by the grade`
         ELSE `pre-reform pay with the Ofek Hadash advance`

-- 2.1.1(6)–(7): the length of the school day follows the end of the day
-- in Ofek Hadash kindergartens (4.1.4), and the timetable the Ofek Hadash
-- work week (section 4) — encoded there.
-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_6 The duty to adjust the school day to the end times of 4.1.4, encoded at `the end of the school day`.
-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_7 The duty to set the timetable by the Ofek Hadash work week, encoded in section 4.

-- 2.1.1(8): the owner transfers to Unique (the Ministry's contractor) the
-- interface of the salary it paid for the month asked; the Ministry sets the
-- grade and converts. 2.1.1(9): once the grade is set, the owner pays by it
-- from the employee's joining, and deducts the advances.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_8 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_8/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the owner transfers the salary interface` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `transfer the salary interface`
    WITHIN 30
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "2.1.1(8): the salary interface goes to the Ministry's contractor for the month asked"

@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_9 akn:art_f__para_17-2/p2
GIVEN `months since joining` IS A NUMBER, `advances paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the owner pays by the grade and deducts the advances` `months since joining` `advances paid` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay by the grade` m PROVIDED m EQUALS `months since joining`
    WITHIN 1
    HENCE (PARTY `the employer`
           MUST  `deduct the advances` d PROVIDED d EQUALS `advances paid`
           WITHIN 1)
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "2.1.1(9): pay by the grade from the joining, and deduct the advances"

-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2 The heading of 2.1.2, the Ministry's actions; they follow.

-- 2.1.2(1): the Ministry approves the joining of owners that signed the
-- undertaking on time and as required.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_1
GIVEN `signed on time and as required` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the Ministry approves the owner's joining` `signed on time and as required` IS
    IF `signed on time and as required`
    THEN PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
         MUST  `approve the owner's joining`
         WITHIN 30
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 2.1.2(2)–(3): the Ministry deals with requests of uncertified employees to
-- join by exception (3.2.1) and of employees asking not to join (3.6);
-- 2.1.2(4): after files and reports, each employee's meeting of the
-- conditions is checked and joining decided; (א) the grade set, (ב) the
-- profile computed, (ג) the owner reimbursed for the employees approved
-- under Ofek Hadash terms, less the advances paid.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3/p3 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3__pnt_a akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3__pnt_b
GIVEN p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `decides joining, grade and profile` p IF
    p EQUALS `the Ministry of Education`

@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3__pnt_c
GIVEN `cost of the approved employees` IS A NUMBER, `advances paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reimbursement to the owner` `cost of the approved employees` `advances paid` IS
    `cost of the approved employees` MINUS `advances paid`

§§ `ב.3 תנאי ההצטרפות`

-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3__pnt_c__pnt_3 The heading "תנאי ההצטרפות" (section 3).
-- akn:art_f__para_3-1 The heading "הגדרות".

-- 3.1.1–3.1.2: new and existing. Internship, IDF service in teaching and
-- national service in teaching are not years of actual teaching here.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-1 akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-2
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a new teaching employee` e IF
    NOT e's `has recognised years of actual teaching`

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-3
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an academic teaching employee` e IF e's `is academic`

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-4
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is certified to teach` e IF e's `holds a teaching certification`

-- akn:art_f__para_3-2 The heading of 3.2 (joining conditions of existing employees).
-- akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1 The heading "existing academic employees".

-- 3.2.1: an existing academic joins when, cumulatively, certified and
-- employed at a third of a position or more. 3.3.1: an existing
-- non-academic with 28 years or more is employed by the reform "in any
-- case". 3.4: a new employee (academic, or non-academic not on intern's
-- pay) is placed in the tables. 3.5.1: interns only by the reform.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_3-3 akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1 akn:art_f__para_3-4
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the joining conditions` e IF
    BRANCH IF e's `is an intern` THEN TRUE
           IF `is a new teaching employee` e THEN TRUE
           IF e's `is academic` THEN e's `holds a teaching certification` AND e's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3
           OTHERWISE e's `seniority in teaching` AT LEAST 28

-- 3.2.1: an uncertified academic may ask to join by exception, through the
-- owner on annex ג' by e-mail, by 31.12.2023.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p6 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p7
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `an exceptional-joining request by 31.12.2023` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `submit an exceptions request` k PROVIDED k EQUALS "join by exception"
    WITHIN `31 December 2023`

GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`, `approved by the exceptions committee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `joins Ofek Hadash with` e `approved by the exceptions committee` IF
        `meets the joining conditions` e
    OR (    e's `is academic`
        AND (NOT e's `holds a teaching certification`)
        AND `approved by the exceptions committee`)

GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `joins Ofek Hadash` e IF
    `meets the joining conditions` e

-- 3.2.1, last paragraph: an uncertified employee with less than 25 years
-- cannot advance in grades until certified; the work period and part of
-- the studies count "כמפורט בסעיף 12.2.2". F-2023-24_tashpad_03-b: 12.2.2
-- does not exist (section 12 is the allowances, 12.2 their rates); the rule
-- is 11.2.2. The reading adopted: 11.2.2.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p8 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p9
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `cannot advance until certified` e IF
        (NOT e's `holds a teaching certification`)
    AND e's `seniority in teaching` LESS THAN 25

`the sections the circular numbers under 12` MEANS LIST "12.1", "12.1.1", "12.1.2", "12.2"
`3.2.1 cites 12.2.2, which is not there` MEANS
    NOT elem "12.2.2" `the sections the circular numbers under 12`
#ASSERT `3.2.1 cites 12.2.2, which is not there`

-- 3.4.1: a new academic in a joined institution is placed at grade 1,
-- seniority 1 — a bachelor's in the bachelor's table, a master's in the
-- master's, a doctorate in the master's plus 5% of the integrated salary.
-- 3.4.2: a new non-academic not on intern's pay (agreement §§145–148) by
-- education: senior, certified or uncertified.
DECLARE `degree` IS ONE OF
    `no degree`
    `bachelor's degree`
    `master's degree`
    `doctorate`

DECLARE `placement` HAS
    `salary table` IS A STRING
    `grade on placement` IS A NUMBER
    `seniority on placement` IS A NUMBER
    `doctorate supplement rate` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p6 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-2
GIVEN d IS A `degree`, `non-academic education` IS A STRING @desc for a non-academic: "senior", "certified" or "uncertified"
GIVETH A `placement`
DECIDE `the placement of a new employee` d `non-academic education` IS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `bachelor's degree` THEN `placement` "bachelor's degree" 1 1 0
    WHEN `master's degree`   THEN `placement` "master's degree" 1 1 0
    WHEN `doctorate`         THEN `placement` "master's degree" 1 1 0.05
    WHEN `no degree`         THEN `placement` `non-academic education` 1 1 0

-- akn:art_f__para_3-5 The heading "מורים מתמחים".

-- 3.5.1: in a joined kindergarten interns are employed only by the reform;
-- the internship year counts only at a third of a position or more for six
-- months or more of the school year (July and August not counted).
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-1
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `months worked September to June` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship year is recognised` `position fraction` `months worked September to June` IF
        `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    AND `months worked September to June` AT LEAST 6

-- 3.5.2: at most two school years, in which the intern must complete a
-- degree and a teaching certificate, or may not go on under the reform.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-2
GIVEN `years of internship` IS A NUMBER, `completed degree and certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may go on under the reform after the internship` `years of internship` `completed degree and certificate` IF
    `years of internship` AT MOST 2 AND `completed degree and certificate`

-- 3.5.3: the internship counts for tenure, jubilee and recuperation
-- seniority, not for salary seniority or the time required for promotion.
DECLARE `seniority purpose` IS ONE OF
    `salary seniority`
    `time required for promotion`
    `tenure`
    `jubilee grant`
    `recuperation`

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-3
GIVEN p IS A `seniority purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship counts for` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `tenure` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `jubilee grant` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `recuperation` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- akn:art_f__para_3-6 The heading "יציאה מאופק חדש".

-- 3.6.1: every employee who meets the conditions must join. 3.6.2–3.6.5:
-- by exception, a request not to join, for health (the employee's or a
-- first-degree relative's, with current medical certificates) or a change
-- for the worse in personal or family circumstances, on annex ד' through
-- the owner by e-mail, by 31.12.2023.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-1
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`, `request not to join granted` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `must join` e `request not to join granted` IF
    `meets the joining conditions` e AND NOT `request not to join granted`

DECLARE `reason not to join` IS ONE OF
    `physical or mental health of the employee or a first-degree relative`
    `a change for the worse in personal or family circumstances`
    `another reason`

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p4
GIVEN r IS A `reason not to join`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a request not to join may be heard for` r IF
    NOT r EQUALS `another reason`

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-3 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-4 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-5
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `a request not to join by 31.12.2023` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `submit an exceptions request` k PROVIDED k EQUALS "not to join"
    WITHIN `31 December 2023`

-- akn:art_f__para_3-7 The heading "גננות ממלאות מקום".

-- 3.7: a substitute employed in weekly hours over time (not single or
-- effective hours) is employed on the characteristics of the teacher
-- replaced.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-7/p2
GIVEN `in weekly timetable hours over time` IS A BOOLEAN, `post replaced` IS A `kindergarten post`, `post otherwise` IS A `kindergarten post`
GIVETH A `kindergarten post`
DECIDE `the substitute's post` `in weekly timetable hours over time` `post replaced` `post otherwise` IS
    IF `in weekly timetable hours over time` THEN `post replaced` ELSE `post otherwise`

§§ `ב.4 מבנה שבוע העבודה`

-- akn:art_f__para_3-7__subpara_4 The heading of section 4 (the work week).
-- akn:art_f__para_4-1 The heading of 4.1, pointing to annex ה'.
-- akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1 The heading "בסיס המשרה".

-- 4.1.1's table (weekly hours of a full position) by post and by age —
-- under 50; 50 to 55 (not included); 55 and above, a "new" teacher
-- (3.1) apart from an "existing" one. Read off the page: the corpus prints
-- its third row and its labels as loose lines.
DECLARE `age band` IS ONE OF
    `under 50`
    `50 to 55 not included`
    `55 and above, new`
    `55 and above, existing`

GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH AN `age band`
DECIDE `the age band of` e IS
    IF e's `age on 31 December` LESS THAN 50 THEN `under 50`
    ELSE IF e's `age on 31 December` LESS THAN 55 THEN `50 to 55 not included`
         ELSE IF `is a new teaching employee` e THEN `55 and above, new`
              ELSE `55 and above, existing`

DECLARE `base row` HAS
    `row age band`         IS AN `age band`
    `manager base`         IS A NUMBER
    `colleague base`       IS A NUMBER
    `cluster manager base` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/t1 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p8
`the position-base table` MEANS
    LIST `base row` `under 50`               30.4 33.8 34,
         `base row` `50 to 55 not included`  28.4 31.8 32,
         `base row` `55 and above, new`      28.4 31.8 32,
         `base row` `55 and above, existing` 26.4 29.8 30

-- 4.1.1's first note: from התשפ"ד the "גננת משלימה" is called "גננת עמיתה".
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p6
`the colleague teacher's former name` MEANS "גננת משלימה"

-- 4.1.1's second note: "for a teacher entitled to age hours, see section 7
-- below". F-2023-24_tashpad_03-c: section 7 is the working mother; age
-- hours are section 8. The reading adopted: section 8.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p7
`the section 4.1.1's note cites for age hours` MEANS 7
`the section that sets age hours` MEANS 8
`the age-hours note cites section 7 but the rule is section 8` MEANS
    NOT (`the section 4.1.1's note cites for age hours` EQUALS `the section that sets age hours`)
#ASSERT `the age-hours note cites section 7 but the rule is section 8`

GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position base of` e IS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row age band` EQUALS `the age band of` e) `the position-base table`
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN
        CONSIDER e's `post`
        WHEN `kindergarten manager teacher` THEN r's `manager base`
        WHEN `cluster kindergarten coordinator` THEN r's `manager base`
        WHEN `colleague kindergarten teacher` THEN r's `colleague base`
        WHEN `kindergarten cluster manager` THEN r's `cluster manager base`
        OTHERWISE `the health and arts week`
    OTHERWISE 0

-- Every age band has one row; and the bases fall by 2 hours at 50 and, for
-- an existing teacher, by 2 more at 55 — the reductions of 8.3–8.5.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN b YIELD count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row age band` EQUALS b) `the position-base table`) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST `under 50`, `50 to 55 not included`, `55 and above, new`, `55 and above, existing`)

-- 4.1.2: the manager's and the colleague's position is frontal hours only.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the position is frontal hours only` p IF
    p EQUALS `kindergarten manager teacher` OR p EQUALS `colleague kindergarten teacher`

-- 4.1.2: a cluster manager's 34 hours, split by the number of kindergartens
-- in the cluster: hours of cluster management, and frontal / enrichment /
-- reinforcement hours with the children.
DECLARE `cluster row` HAS
    `from kindergartens`  IS A NUMBER
    `to kindergartens`    IS A NUMBER
    `frontal hours`       IS A NUMBER
    `management hours`    IS A NUMBER
    `total hours`         IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/t1
`the cluster manager's hours` MEANS
    LIST `cluster row` 4  4  22 12 34,
         `cluster row` 5  5  19 15 34,
         `cluster row` 6  6  16 18 34,
         `cluster row` 7  7  13 21 34,
         `cluster row` 8  8  10 24 34,
         `cluster row` 9  9  7  27 34,
         `cluster row` 10 11 4  30 34

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `cluster row`
DECIDE `the cluster rows for` n IS
    filter (GIVEN r YIELD n AT LEAST r's `from kindergartens` AND n AT MOST r's `to kindergartens`)
           `the cluster manager's hours`

-- Every printed row adds up to its total.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD r's `frontal hours` PLUS r's `management hours` EQUALS r's `total hours`)
            `the cluster manager's hours`

-- F-2023-24_tashpad_03-f: the table starts at 4 kindergartens and ends at
-- 11; section 14 prices the management of a cluster "עד 6 גנים". A cluster
-- of 2 or 3, or of 12 or more, has no split of its hours.
`the cluster-hours table has no row for 3 or 12 kindergartens` MEANS
        count (`the cluster rows for` 3) EQUALS 0
    AND count (`the cluster rows for` 12) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the cluster-hours table has no row for 3 or 12 kindergartens`

-- 4.1.3: work starts at 7:55.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-3
`the start of work` MEANS Time 7 55 0

-- 4.1.4: the end of the school day in Ofek Hadash special-education
-- kindergartens by disability type, Sunday–Thursday and Friday.
DECLARE `disability type` IS ONE OF
    `physical disability`
    `deaf and hard of hearing`
    `blind and visually impaired`
    `moderate intellectual disability`
    `moderate complex intellectual disability`
    `severe, profound or nursing intellectual disability`
    `autism`
    `severe mental disorders`
    `mild intellectual disability`
    `any other kind of class`

@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p8 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p9 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p10 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p11 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p12 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p13
GIVEN d IS A `disability type`
GIVETH A TIME
DECIDE `the end of the school day, Sunday to Thursday` d IS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `autism` THEN Time 16 0 0
    WHEN `severe mental disorders` THEN Time 16 0 0
    WHEN `any other kind of class` THEN Time 14 0 0
    OTHERWISE Time 15 10 0

@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4
GIVEN d IS A `disability type`
GIVETH A TIME
DECIDE `the end of the school day on Friday` d IS
    Time 12 45 0

-- 4.1.4, after the table: a kindergarten that ended at 16:00 before the
-- reform does not lengthen its day on joining, and the teacher adds forty
-- minutes to the day in overlap. A teacher ending at 14:00 works 6.08 hours
-- a day, and so on for the other end times.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p14 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p15
`the overlap minutes added where the day ended at 16:00` MEANS 40

@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p16 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p17
`the working day ending at 14:00, in hours` MEANS 6.08

-- 7:55 to 14:00 is 6 hours 5 minutes, which the circular prints as 6.08.
#ASSERT TRUNC ((14 MINUS 7) MINUS 55 DIVIDED BY 60) 2 EQUALS 6.08

-- 4.1.5: the scope of employment is the weekly hours over the position base.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5/p3
GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER, `position base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the scope of employment` `weekly hours` `position base` IS
    `weekly hours` DIVIDED BY `position base`

-- 4.2: the health-professions employee and arts therapist work 36 hours:
-- 26 frontal, 3 individual (a group of up to 3, or one pupil; their content
-- set with the head of the setting by the Ministry's general instruction),
-- and 7 of "presence" in the kindergarten on the listed activities.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-2
`the health and arts week` MEANS 36
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_a
`their frontal hours` MEANS 26
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_b
`their individual hours` MEANS 3
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c
`their presence hours` MEANS 7

#ASSERT `their frontal hours` PLUS `their individual hours` PLUS `their presence hours` EQUALS `the health and arts week`

DECLARE `presence activity` IS ONE OF
    `adapting the curriculum and the environment to the pupil`
    `individual meetings with parents`
    `preparing for and taking part in committees`
    `planning and guiding the assistants' work`
    `coordinating with bodies outside the kindergarten`
    `coordinating for educational continuity`
    `another activity`

@ref akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p8 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p9
GIVEN a IS A `presence activity`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a presence-hours activity` a IF
    NOT a EQUALS `another activity`

-- akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p10 Pointer to the detailed work-week table of health-professions staff (as in primary schools); no rule here.
-- akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p11 The table's link; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p12 The link's continuation; no rule.

§§ `ב.5–6 חלקיות משרה והעסקה מעל 100%`

-- akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c__cls_5 The heading of section 5 (part-time employment in the reform).

-- 5.1–5.4: the least position in the reform — an existing teacher a third;
-- a new teacher a third unless the head of the HR division approved less;
-- a colleague teacher joins the reform only when her total in the
-- reform's kindergartens is a third or more (and is then reform in those,
-- pre-reform elsewhere); a health-professions employee may be below a third.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-1 akn:art_f__para_5-2 akn:art_f__para_5-3 akn:art_f__para_5-4
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`, `approved below a third by the HR division head` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the position is allowed in the reform` e `approved below a third by the HR division head` IF
    BRANCH IF e's `post` EQUALS `health-professions employee` THEN TRUE
           IF e's `post` EQUALS `arts therapist` THEN TRUE
           IF `is a new teaching employee` e THEN e's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3 OR `approved below a third by the HR division head`
           OTHERWISE e's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

-- 5.5: a part-time health-professions employee's hours are each kind
-- pro-rated; below a third, frontal hours only, and the position is the
-- frontal hours over the base.
DECLARE `hours split` HAS
    `frontal part` IS A NUMBER
    `individual part` IS A NUMBER
    `presence part` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_f__para_5-5 akn:art_f__para_5-5/p2
GIVEN f IS A NUMBER @desc the position fraction
GIVETH AN `hours split`
DECIDE `the health employee's hours` f IS
    IF f LESS THAN 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    THEN `hours split` WITH `frontal part` IS f TIMES `the health and arts week`, `individual part` IS 0, `presence part` IS 0
    ELSE `hours split` WITH `frontal part` IS f TIMES `their frontal hours`, `individual part` IS f TIMES `their individual hours`, `presence part` IS f TIMES `their presence hours`

@ref akn:art_f__para_5-5/p3
GIVEN `frontal hours worked` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the small position of a health employee` `frontal hours worked` IS
    `frontal hours worked` DIVIDED BY `the health and arts week`

-- 5.6: below a third in the reform, the period does not count for the
-- time required for promotion (פז"נ).
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-6
GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the period counts for promotion time` f IF
    f AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

-- akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6 The heading of section 6 (above 100% in the reform).

-- 6: where more than a full position is needed, the weekly total is at
-- most 42 hours, all kinds of employment and hours together; the procedure
-- for employment above 100% has the details (an input).
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p2 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p3 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p4
`the weekly hours cap` MEANS 42

GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the weekly cap` `weekly hours` IF
    `weekly hours` AT MOST `the weekly hours cap`

§§ `ב.7 עובדת הוראה אם`

-- akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_7 The heading of section 7 (the working mother).

-- 7.1: a mother's position per the takanon — a mother of a child up to 14
-- employed at 79% of a position or more.
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-1
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to a mother's position` e IF
    e's `mother of a child under 14` AND e's `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.79

-- 7.2(א): a kindergarten-teacher mother may be absent a whole day every two
-- weeks or half a day every week, pay and position untouched. 7.2(ב): one
-- who, by consent and for the system's needs, is never absent through the
-- year has her position raised by 10%, even above 100%.
DECLARE `mother's arrangement` IS ONE OF
    `a whole day every two weeks`
    `half a day every week`
    `not absent at all, by consent`

@ref akn:art_f__para_7-2 akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_a akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_b akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_b/p2
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`, a IS A `mother's arrangement`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the mother's position` e a IS
    IF `entitled to a mother's position` e AND a EQUALS `not absent at all, by consent`
    THEN e's `position fraction` PLUS 0.1
    ELSE e's `position fraction`

-- 7.3: a health-professions or arts employee who is a mother works the
-- reform's ordinary work-week table (linked) — an input here.
-- akn:art_f__para_7-3 The mother's position of health and arts staff follows the reform's work-week table, linked below; not restated.
-- akn:art_f__para_7-3/p2 The pointer to that table; no rule here.
-- akn:art_f__para_7-3/p3 The table's link; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_7-3/p4 The link's continuation; no rule.

-- 7.4: after maternity leave, an employee at 90% or more has, for four
-- months, one hour a day (five a week) taken off her PRESENCE hours, pay and
-- position untouched; 7.2 and 7.3 do not apply then, and the two reductions
-- are never at once.
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-4 akn:art_f__para_7-4/p2
`the nursing hours a week` MEANS 5

GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the nursing hour` e IF
    e's `entitled to the nursing hour` AND e's `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.9

GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the presence hours of` e IS
    IF `the position is frontal hours only` (e's `post`)
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF e's `post` EQUALS `kindergarten cluster manager`
         THEN 0
         ELSE `their presence hours` TIMES e's `position fraction`

-- F-2023-24_tashpad_03-g: 7.4 takes the nursing hour off the presence
-- hours, and 4.1.2 makes a kindergarten teacher's position frontal hours
-- only: she has no presence hours to take it from. The reading adopted:
-- for a kindergarten teacher the five hours come off her frontal hours.
`a nursing kindergarten teacher` MEANS
    `kindergarten employee` WITH
        `post`                                  IS `kindergarten manager teacher`
        `has recognised years of actual teaching` IS TRUE
        `is academic`                           IS TRUE
        `holds a teaching certification`        IS TRUE
        `seniority in teaching`                 IS 8
        `age on 31 December`                    IS 33
        `position fraction`                     IS 1
        `is an intern`                          IS FALSE
        `holds a special-education certification` IS TRUE
        `entitled to the nursing hour`          IS TRUE
        `mother of a child under 14`            IS TRUE

`a kindergarten teacher has no presence hours for the nursing hour` MEANS
        `has the nursing hour` `a nursing kindergarten teacher`
    AND `the presence hours of` `a nursing kindergarten teacher` LESS THAN `the nursing hours a week`
#ASSERT `a kindergarten teacher has no presence hours for the nursing hour`

GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the weekly hours owed` e IS
    IF `has the nursing hour` e
    THEN `the position base of` e TIMES e's `position fraction` MINUS `the nursing hours a week`
    ELSE `the position base of` e TIMES e's `position fraction`

§§ `ב.8 זכאות לשעות גיל`

-- akn:art_f__para_7-4__subpara_8 The heading of section 8 (age hours).

-- 8.1: the age-hours reduction is set at the start of the year by the age
-- on 31 December of the school year, for the whole year. 8.3: an existing
-- teacher aged 50–55, two frontal hours off the base; 8.4: aged 55 and
-- above, four; 8.5: a new teacher aged 50 and above, two, and none more at
-- 55 — the position percentage untouched. 8.3's "50-55" and 8.4's "55
-- ומעלה" both name 55; the circular's own table (4.1.1) prints "50-55 (לא
-- כולל)", and that is the reading taken here.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-1 akn:art_f__para_8-3 akn:art_f__para_8-4 akn:art_f__para_8-5
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the age hours` e IS
    IF e's `age on 31 December` LESS THAN 50 THEN 0
    ELSE IF `is a new teaching employee` e THEN 2
         ELSE IF e's `age on 31 December` LESS THAN 55 THEN 2
              ELSE 4

-- The table of 4.1.1 is the under-50 base less the age hours.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD
                 LET e MEANS `kindergarten employee` WITH
                         `post`                                  IS `kindergarten manager teacher`
                         `has recognised years of actual teaching` IS TRUE
                         `is academic`                           IS TRUE
                         `holds a teaching certification`        IS TRUE
                         `seniority in teaching`                 IS 20
                         `age on 31 December`                    IS a
                         `position fraction`                     IS 1
                         `is an intern`                          IS FALSE
                         `holds a special-education certification` IS TRUE
                         `entitled to the nursing hour`          IS FALSE
                         `mother of a child under 14`            IS FALSE
                 IN `the position base of` e EQUALS 30.4 MINUS `the age hours` e)
            (LIST 40, 49, 50, 54, 55, 60)

-- 8.2: a teacher aged 50 or more in a part-time position gets a PARTIAL
-- reduction "by the rules set out below". F-2023-24_tashpad_03-h: the
-- paragraphs below (8.3–8.5) state only the whole reductions; no rule for
-- the part is set out. The reading adopted: the age hours in proportion to
-- the position fraction.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-2
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the age hours of a part-time teacher` e IS
    `the age hours` e TIMES min 1 (e's `position fraction`)

`8.3–8.5 set a partial reduction` MEANS FALSE
`8.2's rules for the partial reduction are not set out` MEANS
    NOT `8.3–8.5 set a partial reduction`
#ASSERT `8.2's rules for the partial reduction are not set out`

-- akn:art_f__para_8-6 Age hours of health-professions and arts staff follow the work-week tables, linked below; not restated.
-- akn:art_f__para_8-6/p2 The tables' link; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_8-6/p3 The link's continuation; no rule.

§§ `ב.9 שעות פעילות גן`

-- akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9 The heading of section 9 (kindergarten activity hours).

-- 9.1–9.2: an employee in the reform is paid for the kindergarten's
-- activities beyond the position and fixed pay; at most 40 activity hours
-- in a school year, by the kindergarten's needs; the half-year split is
-- cancelled. 9.3–9.4: what they serve.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p2 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p3 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p4 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p5
`the yearly cap on activity hours` MEANS 40

GIVEN `hours allotted` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the activity hours paid` `hours allotted` IS
    min `hours allotted` `the yearly cap on activity hours`

DECLARE `activity purpose` IS ONE OF
    `staff meetings`
    `general assemblies`
    `individual parents-and-children meetings`
    `an after-hours activity such as a theme party or end-of-year party`
    `another purpose`

@ref akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p6 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p7 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p8 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p9 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p10 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p11 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p12 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p13
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`, a IS AN `activity purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `activity hours may serve` p a IF
    IF p EQUALS `health-professions employee` OR p EQUALS `arts therapist`
    THEN a EQUALS `general assemblies`
         OR a EQUALS `individual parents-and-children meetings`
         OR a EQUALS `an after-hours activity such as a theme party or end-of-year party`
    ELSE a EQUALS `staff meetings`
         OR a EQUALS `individual parents-and-children meetings`
         OR a EQUALS `an after-hours activity such as a theme party or end-of-year party`

§§ `ב.10–11 ותק וקידום בדרגות`

-- akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_10 The heading of section 10 (seniority in teaching).

-- 10.1: recognised seniority for the salary table is the takanon's, without
-- the internship or compulsory IDF service, with IDF or national service in
-- teaching. 10.2: an existing employee keeps every year recognised for
-- salary on the eve of joining.
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-1 akn:art_f__para_10-2
GIVEN `takanon seniority` IS A NUMBER, `internship years` IS A NUMBER, `compulsory IDF years` IS A NUMBER, `years recognised before joining` IS A NUMBER, `is existing` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the recognised seniority` `takanon seniority` `internship years` `compulsory IDF years` `years recognised before joining` `is existing` IS
    IF `is existing`
    THEN max (`takanon seniority` MINUS `internship years` MINUS `compulsory IDF years`) `years recognised before joining`
    ELSE `takanon seniority` MINUS `internship years` MINUS `compulsory IDF years`

-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11 The heading of section 11 (promotion, evaluation, professional development).

-- 11.1: promotion needs the required time (פז"נ), professional-development
-- hours (שפ"מ) and an evaluation, by the Ministry's instructions (linked).
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p2 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p3 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p4 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p8
GIVEN `months in the grade` IS A NUMBER, `development hours` IS A NUMBER, `evaluation passed` IS A BOOLEAN, `months required` IS A NUMBER, `hours required` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be promoted` `months in the grade` `development hours` `evaluation passed` `months required` `hours required` IF
        `months in the grade` AT LEAST `months required`
    AND `development hours` AT LEAST `hours required`
    AND `evaluation passed`

-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p5 Pointer to the professional-development outline; no rule here.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p6 Its link; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p7 The link's continuation; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p9 Pointer to the evaluation details; no rule here.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p10 Its link; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p11 Pointer to the map of indicators; no rule here.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p12 Its link; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p13 The link's continuation; no rule.

DECLARE `promotion row` HAS
    `from grade` IS A NUMBER
    `months required for the step` IS A NUMBER
    `hours required for the step` IS A NUMBER

-- 11.2.1: academic employees certified to teach.
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p14 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p15 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p16 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/t1
`the promotion table for certified academics` MEANS
    LIST `promotion row` 1 30 120,
         `promotion row` 2 30 120,
         `promotion row` 3 36 180,
         `promotion row` 4 36 180,
         `promotion row` 5 36 180,
         `promotion row` 6 48 210,
         `promotion row` 7 48 210,
         `promotion row` 8 48 210

-- 11.2.3: certified non-academics with 28 years or more, who need not
-- complete an academic education.
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p23 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p24 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/t2
`the promotion table for certified non-academics` MEANS
    LIST `promotion row` 1 48 480,
         `promotion row` 2 48 480,
         `promotion row` 3 48 480,
         `promotion row` 4 48 480,
         `promotion row` 5 48 480,
         `promotion row` 6 48 480,
         `promotion row` 7 48 480,
         `promotion row` 8 48 480

GIVEN g IS A NUMBER, t IS A LIST OF `promotion row`
GIVETH A LIST OF `promotion row`
DECIDE `the step from grade` g `in` t IS
    filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `from grade` EQUALS g) t

#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD count (`the step from grade` g `in` `the promotion table for certified academics`) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8)

-- 11.2.2: uncertified academics who joined by exception. With up to 25
-- years they cannot advance until certified; once certified, the time and
-- hours count from their joining, for one promotion only, and up to 60
-- hours of the certification studies count towards the hours. With 25 years
-- or more they need no certification. A NEW uncertified employee who joined
-- by exception has none of these benefits and starts counting at
-- certification. ("עד 25" and "25 ומעלה" both name 25; 3.2.1 says "below
-- 25", and that is the reading taken here.)
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p17 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p18 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p19 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p20 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p21 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p22
`the certification hours that count, at most` MEANS 60

GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`, `certified since joining` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may count time from joining, for one promotion` e `certified since joining` IF
        e's `is academic`
    AND (NOT `is a new teaching employee` e)
    AND e's `seniority in teaching` LESS THAN 25
    AND `certified since joining`

GIVEN `certification study hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the study hours counted as development hours` `certification study hours` IS
    min `certification study hours` `the certification hours that count, at most`

§§ `ב.12–15 גמולים`

-- 12: the kindergarten manager's management allowance. 12.1: notwithstanding
-- §138(א)(1) of the Ofek Hadash agreement, from 1.9.2023 it is the HIGHER of
-- 12.1.1 the rate of the integrated salary that section sets, and 12.1.2
-- ₪1,500. 12.2: the other rules on it stay as they were.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-1__subpara_12-1-1/p2
`the management allowance floor` MEANS 1500

DECLARE `management rate row` HAS
    `new teacher's grades from` IS A NUMBER
    `new teacher's grades to` IS A NUMBER
    `existing teacher's management years from` IS A NUMBER
    `existing teacher's management years to` IS A NUMBER
    `management rate` IS A NUMBER

-- The rates of the allowance in the reform (the table printed as lines):
-- a new teacher by grade, an existing one by years of management.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p3 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p4 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p5 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p6 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p7 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p8
`the management rates` MEANS
    LIST `management rate row` 1 2 0  5   0.17,
         `management rate row` 3 4 6  10  0.20,
         `management rate row` 5 9 11 999 0.21

GIVEN `is new` IS A BOOLEAN, `grade` IS A NUMBER, `management years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the management rate` `is new` `grade` `management years` IS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN r YIELD
                         IF `is new`
                         THEN `grade` AT LEAST r's `new teacher's grades from` AND `grade` AT MOST r's `new teacher's grades to`
                         ELSE `management years` AT LEAST r's `existing teacher's management years from` AND `management years` AT MOST r's `existing teacher's management years to`)
                     `the management rates`
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN r's `management rate`
    OTHERWISE 0

-- F-2023-24_tashpad_03-k: the ₪1,500 of 12.1.2 is a fixed sum beside a
-- rate of the integrated salary, and the circular does not say whether a
-- part-time manager takes it whole or in proportion to her position. The
-- reading adopted: in proportion to the position, as the rate is.
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_12 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_12/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-1 akn:art_f__para_12-1__subpara_12-1-1 akn:art_f__para_12-2
GIVEN `integrated salary at the position` IS A NUMBER, `rate` IS A NUMBER, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the management allowance` `integrated salary at the position` `rate` `position fraction` IS
    max (`integrated salary at the position` TIMES `rate`) (`the management allowance floor` TIMES min 1 `position fraction`)

GIVEN `integrated salary at the position` IS A NUMBER, `rate` IS A NUMBER, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the management allowance with the floor whole` `integrated salary at the position` `rate` `position fraction` IS
    max (`integrated salary at the position` TIMES `rate`) `the management allowance floor`

`the floor read whole or pro-rated differs for a half-time manager` MEANS
    NOT (`the management allowance` 4000 0.17 0.5 EQUALS `the management allowance with the floor whole` 4000 0.17 0.5)
#ASSERT `the floor read whole or pro-rated differs for a half-time manager`

-- 12.2's note: a teacher entitled, on the eve of appointment, to a trailing
-- management or counselling allowance gets the higher of it and the
-- management allowance.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2/p9
GIVEN `management allowance` IS A NUMBER, `trailing allowance` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the allowance with a trailing one` `management allowance` `trailing allowance` IS
    max `management allowance` `trailing allowance`

-- akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13 The heading of section 13 (the colleague teacher's supplement).
-- akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1 The heading "לעניין סעיף זה".

-- 13.1: the colleague teacher (fills in on a fixed day when the manager
-- does not work, with all the duties of the teacher in charge) is
-- "eligible" when she has none of: the kindergarten management allowance
-- (§138א), the education allowance (§138ב), a trailing management or
-- counselling allowance (§§50א, 140ו), the cluster-management allowance
-- (§144ג(א) as amended 17.6.2021), or any pay-protection component (§§38ב, 38ג).
DECLARE `colleague teacher` HAS
    `on a fixed day in charge of the kindergarten` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a listed allowance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc any of the allowances or pay-protection components of section 13.1
    `colleague's position fraction` IS A NUMBER
    `colleague's integrated salary` IS A NUMBER @desc the integrated salary for a full position

@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p6 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p7 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p8
GIVEN c IS A `colleague teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an eligible colleague teacher` c IF
    c's `on a fixed day in charge of the kindergarten` AND NOT c's `has a listed allowance`

-- 13.2: from 1.9.2023, 10% of the integrated salary, in proportion to a
-- part-time position; above 100%, what a full position gets.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-2
`the colleague supplement rate` MEANS 0.1

@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-2
GIVEN c IS A `colleague teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the colleague teacher's supplement` c IS
    IF `is an eligible colleague teacher` c
    THEN `the colleague supplement rate` TIMES c's `colleague's integrated salary` TIMES min 1 (c's `colleague's position fraction`)
    ELSE 0

-- 13.3: the supplement counts for the hourly value, severance pay,
-- substitution hours and school activities, the reduction for an hour of
-- absence, §33ד's payment, the training fund and (in an accumulating
-- pension) pension provisions; it is not part of the integrated salary and
-- not a base for other supplements.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-3
GIVEN `use` IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the colleague supplement counts for` `use` IF
    elem `use` (LIST "hourly value", "severance pay", "substitution hours", "school activities",
                     "absence reduction", "section 33d payment", "training fund", "accumulating pension")

-- 14: the special-education cluster manager — 25% management allowance up
-- to 6 kindergartens, 28% from 7; a cluster coordinator, a 10% education
-- allowance where not entitled to a trailing management allowance; and a
-- mentor's allowance of 2.4% for each intern, up to three.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p3 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p4
GIVEN `kindergartens in the cluster` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cluster management rate` `kindergartens in the cluster` IS
    IF `kindergartens in the cluster` AT MOST 6 THEN 0.25 ELSE 0.28

@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p5 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p6 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p7
GIVEN `has a trailing management allowance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the coordinator's education rate` `has a trailing management allowance` IS
    IF `has a trailing management allowance` THEN 0 ELSE 0.1

@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p8 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p9
GIVEN `interns mentored` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the mentor's rate` `interns mentored` IS
    0.024 TIMES min `interns mentored` 3

-- 15: the special-education allowance (agreement of 19.10.2022, §39א(3) of
-- the Ofek Hadash agreement), from 1.9.2023: certified in special
-- education, 9% becomes 10% and 14% becomes 15%, and 17% in a kindergarten
-- of the autism or severe-mental-disorders type; NOT certified in special
-- education, (א) 5.5% and (ב) "in special education", 8.5%.
-- akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15 The heading of section 15.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_1__cls_a akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_1__cls_b akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_1__cls_c
GIVEN `rate before` IS A NUMBER, d IS A `disability type`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special-education rate if certified` `rate before` d IS
    IF `rate before` EQUALS 0.14 AND (d EQUALS `autism` OR d EQUALS `severe mental disorders`)
    THEN 0.17
    ELSE IF `rate before` EQUALS 0.09 THEN 0.10
         ELSE IF `rate before` EQUALS 0.14 THEN 0.15
              ELSE `rate before`

-- F-2023-24_tashpad_03-i: for a teacher not certified in special education
-- (א) gives 5.5% to "teaching employees not certified in special
-- education" and (ב) 8.5% to "teaching employees in special education not
-- certified in special education". Every employee this circular governs
-- teaches in special education, so both rows take her. The reading adopted:
-- (ב), the more specific row, governs here.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_2__cls_a
`the uncertified rate in (א)` MEANS 0.055
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_2__cls_b
`the uncertified rate in (ב)` MEANS 0.085

GIVEN `teaches in special education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the uncertified rows that apply` `teaches in special education` IS
    IF `teaches in special education`
    THEN LIST `the uncertified rate in (א)`, `the uncertified rate in (ב)`
    ELSE LIST `the uncertified rate in (א)`

`an uncertified special-education kindergarten teacher has two rates` MEANS
    `the uncertified rows that apply` TRUE EQUALS LIST 0.055, 0.085
#ASSERT `an uncertified special-education kindergarten teacher has two rates`

@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_2__cls_a akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_2__cls_b
GIVEN `teaches in special education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special-education rate if not certified` `teaches in special education` IS
    IF `teaches in special education` THEN `the uncertified rate in (ב)` ELSE `the uncertified rate in (א)`

§§ `ב.16 קביעת הדרגה באופק חדש`

-- akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_16 The heading of section 16.

-- 16: no grade without an open file, a reported position and joining.
-- 16.1: the Ministry alone sets it; 16.2: from the employment, education,
-- seniority and pay in the conversion month; 16.3: for an existing
-- employee, by conversion of March of the year before joining (seniority,
-- education, in-service allowances, role, stage); 16.4: the pay converted —
-- the components that do not continue in Ofek Hadash, at 100% of a
-- position, in that March's salary; 16.5: half grades allowed.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_16/p2 akn:art_f__para_16-1
GIVEN `file opened` IS A BOOLEAN, `position reported` IS A BOOLEAN, `joined` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a grade can be set` `file opened` `position reported` `joined` IF
    `file opened` AND `position reported` AND `joined`

@ref akn:art_f__para_16-2 akn:art_f__para_16-3 akn:art_f__para_16-4
GIVEN `year of joining` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year the employee joins (2023 for התשפ"ד)
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the conversion month of an existing employee` `year of joining` IS
    Date 1 3 (`year of joining` MINUS 1)

@ref akn:art_f__para_16-5
GIVEN g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a grade a conversion may give` g IF
    g AT LEAST 1 AND g AT MOST 9 AND (g TIMES 2) EQUALS TRUNC (g TIMES 2) 0

-- akn:art_f__para_16-5/p2 Pointer to the Ofek Hadash salary tables; no rule here.
-- akn:art_f__para_16-5/p3 Its link; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_16-5/p4 Pointer to the 2016 shekel-supplement circular; no rule here.
-- akn:art_f__para_16-5/p5 Its link; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_16-5/p6 Pointer to the 2022 Ofek supplement circular; no rule here.
-- akn:art_f__para_16-5/p7 Its link; no rule.

§§ `ב.17 מקדמות שכר עד לקביעת הדרגה`

-- akn:art_f__para_16-5__subpara_17 The heading of section 17.

-- 17.1: until the grade is set, advances are paid to employees the
-- Ministry joined, on top of the current (non-Ofek) pay, computed on the
-- current pay's components listed. 17.2: only for the part of the
-- employment in a joined kindergarten, from the joining; the owner computes
-- and pays it, as "מקדמת אופק חדש". 17.3: the rates.
DECLARE `advance class` IS ONE OF
    `academic kindergarten teacher`
    `academic health-professions employee`
    `intern`
    `non-academic with 28 years or more`
    `another employee`

@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p2 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p3 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p4 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p5 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p6
GIVEN c IS AN `advance class`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the advance rate` c IS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `academic kindergarten teacher` THEN JUST 0.16
    WHEN `academic health-professions employee` THEN JUST 0.14
    WHEN `intern` THEN JUST 0.14
    WHEN `non-academic with 28 years or more` THEN JUST 0.10
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH AN `advance class`
DECIDE `the advance class of` e IS
    BRANCH IF e's `is an intern` THEN `intern`
           IF e's `is academic` AND (e's `post` EQUALS `health-professions employee` OR e's `post` EQUALS `arts therapist`) THEN `academic health-professions employee`
           IF e's `is academic` THEN `academic kindergarten teacher`
           IF e's `seniority in teaching` AT LEAST 28 THEN `non-academic with 28 years or more`
           OTHERWISE `another employee`

-- F-2023-24_tashpad_03-l: 3.4.2 joins a NEW non-academic employee (not on
-- intern's pay) to the reform, placed by education; 17.3 gives a
-- non-academic a rate only "for an employee with 28 years or more". A new
-- non-academic is joined and has no advance rate. The reading adopted: no
-- advance — such an employee is paid by the grade 3.4.2 places her in.
`a new non-academic kindergarten teacher` MEANS
    `kindergarten employee` WITH
        `post`                                  IS `kindergarten manager teacher`
        `has recognised years of actual teaching` IS FALSE
        `is academic`                           IS FALSE
        `holds a teaching certification`        IS TRUE
        `seniority in teaching`                 IS 0
        `age on 31 December`                    IS 30
        `position fraction`                     IS 1
        `is an intern`                          IS FALSE
        `holds a special-education certification` IS FALSE
        `entitled to the nursing hour`          IS FALSE
        `mother of a child under 14`            IS FALSE

`a joined new non-academic has no advance rate` MEANS
        `joins Ofek Hadash` `a new non-academic kindergarten teacher`
    AND `the advance rate` (`the advance class of` `a new non-academic kindergarten teacher`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `a joined new non-academic has no advance rate`

@desc The components of the current pay the advance is computed on (17.1).
DECLARE `current pay` HAS
    `components for the advance` IS A NUMBER @desc the sum of: integrated salary, the '87 and '94 supplements, the 2001, 2008 and 2011 supplements, the profession-and-training allowance, in-service allowances and the double-degree allowance
    `share in joined kindergartens` IS A NUMBER @desc the part of the employment in a joined recognised unofficial special-education kindergarten

@ref akn:art_f__para_17-1 akn:art_f__para_17-2
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`, p IS A `current pay`, `grade set` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ofek Hadash advance` e p `grade set` IS
    IF `joins Ofek Hadash` e AND NOT `grade set`
    THEN CONSIDER `the advance rate` (`the advance class of` e)
         WHEN JUST r THEN r TIMES p's `components for the advance` TIMES p's `share in joined kindergartens`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:art_f__para_17-2
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`, p IS A `current pay`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 3 action`
DECIDE `the owner pays the Ofek Hadash advance` e p IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the Ofek Hadash advance` a PROVIDED a EQUALS `the Ofek Hadash advance` e p FALSE
    WITHIN 1
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "17.2: the owner computes the advance and pays it to each employee"

-- 17.2, second paragraph: once the grade is set, pay is recomputed under
-- Ofek Hadash back to the joining, and the pay already paid for that
-- period (pre-reform pay and the advance) is set off.
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-2/p2
GIVEN `Ofek Hadash pay for the period` IS A NUMBER, `pre-reform pay paid` IS A NUMBER, `advances paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the retroactive difference` `Ofek Hadash pay for the period` `pre-reform pay paid` `advances paid` IS
    `Ofek Hadash pay for the period` MINUS `pre-reform pay paid` MINUS `advances paid`

-- 17.3, the closing paragraph: the circular gathers the collective
-- agreements' rules; where it contradicts them, for or against the
-- employee, the agreements prevail.
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3/p7
GIVEN `the circular's answer` IS A NUMBER, `the agreements' answer` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `what applies` `the circular's answer` `the agreements' answer` IS
    `the agreements' answer`

