§§ `כתב ההתחייבות`

-- The owner's undertaking (nested by the corpus under 17.3), its last day
-- 31.8.23 (encoded at `the owner signs the undertaking by 31.8.2023`), the
-- signatory's details and the regulation it quotes.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p34 The undertaking's title; no rule of its own.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p35 The undertaking's last day (31.8.23), encoded at `the owner signs the undertaking by 31.8.2023`.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p36 The signatory's identification blanks; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p37 The amended regulation it quotes, encoded at `the kindergarten is in Ofek Hadash`.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p38 The quoted regulation; encoded there.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p39 The quoted regulation's continuation; encoded there.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p40 The lead-in to the items undertaken; no rule of its own.

-- Items 1–2: apply from התשפ"ד every Ofek Hadash provision on kindergartens
-- (agreement of 25.12.2008 as updated) — work week, school day, pay,
-- pedagogical instructions — and hand the Ministry all data asked for.
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_1 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_2
DECLARE `undertaking action` IS ONE OF
    `apply Ofek Hadash in every kindergarten`
    `hand over the data asked`
    `mark the advance on the payslip`
    `send each employee the letter`
    `have each employee sign the undertaking`
    `keep the employees' undertakings and hand them over on demand`
    `have an uncertified employee undertake to complete the education`
    `hand over the payslips on demand`

-- Item 3: pay the advance and (א) mark it on the payslip "מקדמת אופק חדש",
-- (ב) send each employee the letter of annex א' that it will be deducted in
-- full on pay by the grade, (ג) have each employee sign annex ב'. Item 4:
-- keep the undertakings and hand them over on demand. Item 5: an employee
-- without the required teaching certificate who asks to be employed under
-- Ofek Hadash undertakes to complete the education (annex ג'). Item 6: hand
-- over payslips on demand.
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_3 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_3__cls_a akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_3__cls_b akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_3__cls_c akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_4 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_5 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_6
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `undertaking action`
DECIDE `the owner's undertakings on the advance` IS
    (PARTY `the employer`
     MUST  `mark the advance on the payslip`
     WITHIN 1)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the employer`
     MUST  `send each employee the letter`
     WITHIN 1)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the employer`
     MUST  `have each employee sign the undertaking`
     WITHIN 1)

-- Item 7: an employee who, for special personal reasons, asks not to join
-- may apply through the owner to the exceptions committee (annex ד') — as
-- in 3.6. Breach of the undertakings may bring sanctions, from set-off of
-- the sums budgeted for applying Ofek Hadash up to revocation of the licence.
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p2
DECLARE `sanction` IS ONE OF
    `set-off of the sums budgeted for Ofek Hadash`
    `revocation of the licence`

@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `undertaking action`
DECIDE `the owner applies Ofek Hadash on pain of sanctions` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `apply Ofek Hadash in every kindergarten`
    WITHIN 365
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "the undertaking: breach may bring sanctions up to revocation of the licence"

-- akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p3 The signatory's confirmation that the undertaking was read; no rule of its own.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p4 Signature block; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p5 Signature blanks; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p6 Signature blanks; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p7 Date blank; no rule.

§§ `נספחים`

-- Annex א': the owner's letter to the employee — on joining, the
-- grade (and the pay) is set by the Ministry; until then an advance on
-- account is paid; with the grade, the pre-reform pay and the advance are
-- deducted in full, subject to the Wage Protection Law 1958; the advance
-- shows on the payslip as "מקדמת אופק חדש".
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p13 akn:att_1__hc_1/p14 akn:att_1__hc_1/p15
GIVEN `deduction` IS A NUMBER, `allowed by the Wage Protection Law` IS A NUMBER @desc the most the Wage Protection Law 1958 allows deducted from the month's pay
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the advance deducted in the month` `deduction` `allowed by the Wage Protection Law` IS
    min `deduction` `allowed by the Wage Protection Law`

-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 Annex א's note that it stays with the owner (as 2.1.1(1) says); no rule of its own.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 Date blank; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 Addressee; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 Addressee blanks; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p5 Address blanks; no rule.
